WEBVTT

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:04.530
--What?
--Huh?!

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:10.570
Is this some sort of event?

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:13.040
It must be a surprise.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.180
Gather everyone here.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.580
Otherwise, we will shoot.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.010
Hayato!

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.510
Save us!

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:22.580
So long as you comply, we have no intent to cause you harm.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:23.590
Kento?!

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.920
Why?!

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.690
Orders from above.

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:32.690
As I have just explained, the decision of the Japanese Government

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:37.130
is that Deava is the enemy and we will follow Nesta's orders.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.100
Deava will be dismantled.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:41.100
"Obey"

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:47.240
The Book of Verbalism exerts absolute power over people and things around it.

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:50.780
If he had gone to the center of government once he had the book,

00:00:50.780 --> 00:00:53.880
he could have turned the situation in his favor from the beginning.

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:57.720
Yet Dad never did that...

00:00:57.720 --> 00:01:03.390
Yes, Subete Kenzaki, he chose not to, in order to let you grow.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:07.900
All the battles so far...
The humiliation... The despair...

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:12.470
It all led me to this point!

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:14.570
I will defeat Akira.

00:01:14.570 --> 00:01:19.740
If his wish is to save the world,
I exist to destroy it.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.280
So, I will erase them!

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.980
"Smile/Laugh"

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:27.410
Smiles and laughter lead to happiness.
I'll erase the very concept of them!

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:33.790
Rejoice. I shall now set you free.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.930
You're going to have an
M.J.B.K. eat that concept?

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:39.830
That is only the first step.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:42.760
For the complete eradication of written culture,

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:45.460
I need Aquarion Logos.

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:50.460
Maia, Gattai with me.

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:59.550
<i>The world is engulfed by an unvoiced scream</i>

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:05.490
<i>and I wait for it to reach and stir</i> <i>a certain someone's heart</i>

00:02:05.490 --> 00:02:11.290
<i>With strength flowing to the edges of our souls</i>

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:17.570
<i>we set out into the white</i> <i>morning haze, without hesitation</i>

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.500
<i>I want to know everything about you</i>

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:30.500
<i>But just when I thought</i>
<i>I had you, you were gone</i>

00:02:35.350 --> 00:02:39.590
<i>It's love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:02:39.590 --> 00:02:46.190
<i>These tightly-sealed, silent lips</i>

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:50.570
<i>gently reply back in kind</i>

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:54.840
<i>And with love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:02:54.840 --> 00:03:01.340
<i>Now, from the last of the words I couldn't find,</i>

00:03:01.340 --> 00:03:10.050
<i>the music begins</i>

00:03:21.400 --> 00:03:24.930
"Tragic! An Immoral Gattai"

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.530
Don't engage in any futile resistance.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:31.100
Look us in the eyes, and you'll see we're serious.

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:37.250
He's right. If you look at their eyes, you can tell.

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:40.480
"Obey"

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.920
So that's how it is, huh? Well, then...

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:46.960
Yeah, yeah. We'll do as you say.

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:48.560
Don't move!

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:50.290
Hey!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:54.560
Shoko, activate Vector-2 remotely.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:57.400
By touch, so they won't notice.

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:58.430
Huh?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.070
Please.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.400
Aquarion Logos...

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:07.440
Yes, the coming of Aquarion Logos is the best way of ending the world.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:12.410
You're going to end the world... just so you can beat Akira?

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:15.680
This is nonsense... How can you be so selfish?!

00:04:22.090 --> 00:04:25.490
Watch your tongue with me, puppet!

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.630
S-Subete...

00:04:27.630 --> 00:04:30.600
I will become better than him!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:32.590
I don't have any time left to waste.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:36.760
Because Akira is going to vanish?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.280
Gattai with me, Maia.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.810
I refuse!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:44.280
I'll never Gattai with you!

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:46.980
And I won't let Akira vanish, either!

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.140
"Vector-2 Activate Cell Motor

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.140
Vector-2 Auto-Scan System

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.140
Vector-2 Force Lock System"

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.940
What?

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.700
Shoko, what happened?

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:10.140
I have no clue!

00:05:10.140 --> 00:05:14.340
I just launched Vector-2 in autopilot, like the manager told me to!

00:05:14.340 --> 00:05:15.830
Why, you...!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.350
Akira!

00:05:19.350 --> 00:05:21.380
I've got it!

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.520
Kaibuki!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:26.990
If all we're doing is sending it to the pilot it's bound to by Verbalism,

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:31.190
it's not impossible to do that in autopilot.

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:37.160
Vector-2?! Why is it here?!

00:05:39.700 --> 00:05:41.530
Mai...a...

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.670
Fire!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:52.380
Stay away from me!

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:55.410
You bastard! What do you think you're doing to her?!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.010
It hurts...

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:11.530
Stop!

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:14.400
Shoko! That's dangerous! Get out of his way!

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:15.890
I will not!

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:16.960
"Obey"

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:27.550
Tsutomu! Tsutomu!

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:30.880
Tsutomu! Hang in there! Tsutomu!

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:36.060
Sh-Shoko... Your breasts are touching me.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.550
You dummy!

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:43.060
We've done enough.
We have to believe in Akira now.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:47.900
Now that we've given him an opening by launching Vector-2, our part is over.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.410
Akira...

00:06:50.410 --> 00:06:56.080
Now, if Vector-Ga, which eats kanji and their concepts, will just activate...

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.580
Verbalize.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.840
"Akira Kaibuki"

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:59.840
"Verbalize"

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:04.850
"Obey"

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.750
Huh? Where am I?

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:08.290
Get him to the medical room at once!

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:09.760
Get a stretcher over here!

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:10.760
We need to stop the bleeding!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:15.660
Their eyes showed they were being controlled with the Book of Verbalism.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:20.470
In which case, we need to neutralize the book's power to get through this.

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:22.270
With the power of the monument?

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:24.840
Vector-Ga can't be activated by computer.

00:07:24.840 --> 00:07:28.110
We had no choice but to send Akira there directly.

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:33.110
Honestly, you forced us to join you in far too risky a gamble.

00:07:33.110 --> 00:07:34.280
I'm sorry.

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:38.020
They had me under surveillance, and I couldn't talk to you in advance.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.290
I'll defeat the M.J.B.K. I'm going on ahead.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.290
What?! You idiot! What are you going to do there all alone?!

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.990
Let's get going, too!

00:07:44.990 --> 00:07:46.290
But...

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:49.800
M-Me and Shoko will look after him!

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:51.300
I'm counting on you.

00:07:51.300 --> 00:07:52.370
Okay!

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:54.230
You came for me.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.390
Is something the matter?

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.250
No, it's nothing.

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:18.380
I'll launch.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.900
My, what a splendid party!

00:08:30.510 --> 00:08:33.270
Maybe I'll join in myself!

00:08:46.050 --> 00:08:49.020
Well then, shall we dance?

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.880
"Voice ID

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.880
Hayato Kujyo

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:15.880
Karan Uminagi"

00:09:12.280 --> 00:09:14.920
You're as needlessly reckless as ever, Kaibuki.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.550
Big Brother, let's do our part, too!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.760
Akira!

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:21.920
You're late!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.260
Sorry.

00:09:23.260 --> 00:09:25.630
Let's go! All units Gattai!

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.890
--Roger!
--Roger!

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.060
Sousei Gattai.

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.760
Shout!

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:30.900
Fly!

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.130
Aquarion!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.900
Aquarion!!

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.450
"San"

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:47.940
San!

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.520
"Gai"

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.110
Gai!

00:09:59.430 --> 00:10:00.930
Is it here?

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.160
Subete...

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:04.930
The machine that ended the legend... Vector-Ga.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.490
Show me its power!

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.140
He's not stabilizing!

00:10:17.140 --> 00:10:18.680
Injecting 100 ml of lidocaine.

00:10:18.680 --> 00:10:21.320
Don't we have blood for transfusion?
Tell them to bring it quickly!

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.950
He's bleeding badly.

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.780
We'll perform the procedure here.
Prepare to operate.

00:10:29.960 --> 00:10:32.360
Tsutomu.

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.800
Kikogami is with him.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.290
Yes.

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.800
What?!

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.640
In an area centered around Shinjuku,

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:45.540
multiple unidentified giant humanoid robots have appeared!

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:46.970
What are they?

00:10:46.970 --> 00:10:48.180
Could these be...?!

00:10:48.180 --> 00:10:50.680
Aquarions?

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:54.670
Let's dance, my destroying angels.

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:42.620
It's her! These waves of power!

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.360
"Yusuke: I know we promised to go to Hokkaido,

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.360
but I don't think I'm going to be able to.

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.360
Takeko: Don't make stupid jokes like that!

00:11:48.870 --> 00:11:52.360
Yusuke: I love you. I love you so much. I love..."

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:54.880
Accursed writing!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:58.400
It's because things like this exist...!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.380
"Yusuke: I know we promised to go to Hokkaido,

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.380
but I don't think I'm going to be able to.

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.380
Takeko: Don't make stupid jokes like that!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:58.380
Yusuke: I love you. I love you so much. I love..."

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:06.150
I'll save them. I'm not going to let her do any more!

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.560
What's wrong?

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:09.890
Soon...

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:11.790
What's wrong, Maia? Maia?

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:13.450
...he will...

00:12:15.060 --> 00:12:16.630
Are you okay, Maia?

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.470
That look... What happened?

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:20.800
...vanish.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.400
No...

00:12:23.400 --> 00:12:25.240
No!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:38.250
Nesta, I will devour the very concept of you!

00:12:38.250 --> 00:12:40.450
I won't let you kill Maia!

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:41.920
Akira?

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:43.460
Devour.

00:12:43.460 --> 00:12:47.430
Devour! Devour!

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:50.830
You... You know, don't you?

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:54.170
What it is that you're doing...

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.700
You'll disappear if you do this; do you realize that?!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:04.280
Yeah, and?

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:05.940
You idiot!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.990
Get out of the way, M.J.B.K.!

00:13:13.990 --> 00:13:15.890
We need to do something!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.630
Serves you all right.

00:13:46.190 --> 00:13:50.220
What... can I do?

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:53.330
By being with Subete...

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:55.890
That is the same power as mine.

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.830
I'm sorry, Akira.

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:09.040
No! What are you doing, Maia?!

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:10.880
Stop! Maia!

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:15.220
I see!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.380
Sousei Gattai!

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:20.020
Sousei... Gattai.

00:14:20.020 --> 00:14:21.390
Carve!

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:25.380
Aquarion!

00:14:33.530 --> 00:14:37.870
I'm sorry, Akira! I know it's wrong, but...

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:42.400
I... I... feel so good!

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.980
"Ressho"

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.540
Ressho!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.950
Power!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:05.400
That puppet!

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:17.280
Maia?

00:15:17.280 --> 00:15:18.810
Foolish girl.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.910
Nesta?

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:25.620
What it means to obtain the same power I have...

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:30.090
It seems she doesn't understand that.

00:15:30.090 --> 00:15:38.330
Your mere artificial body could not act as a stable vessel for my soul.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:40.600
However, if you gain the same power as me,

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:44.810
you raise your completeness as a vessel, and that changes things.

00:15:44.810 --> 00:15:48.110
Nesta! What do you think you're doing to Maia?!

00:15:54.780 --> 00:15:59.490
Oh, my! Did you still have a lingering affection for this puppet?

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.960
But you shouldn't push yourself.

00:16:01.960 --> 00:16:06.130
Akira Kaibuki isn't the only one short on time.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.360
You are, too.

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:11.370
Y-You...!

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:16.870
Now then, let's get our little destruction party back on track!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:20.710
Sorry, party's over.

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:25.180
Akira! Destroy this machine!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:28.050
Impale Subete and me with him!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.020
The enemy you must defeat is right here!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.820
Now is your only chance! Do it!

00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.660
Maia...

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:39.030
What are you thinking?!

00:16:39.030 --> 00:16:44.400
You seem panicked. It seems if we kill you while you have a body...

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:47.200
No! Was this your plan from the beginning?

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:50.570
Even a phantom like you won't walk away unscathed!

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.510
You're only a puppet!

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.840
What?

00:16:56.840 --> 00:17:00.180
The black Aquarions have started to move again!

00:17:00.180 --> 00:17:02.250
We can't evacuate them in time!

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.550
I'll go!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.720
Kikogami? What are you thinking?!

00:17:05.720 --> 00:17:07.550
I... I can at least buy time.

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:10.060
That's crazy! You can't hope to do anything with just one Vector!

00:17:10.060 --> 00:17:11.530
There's another victim over here!

00:17:11.530 --> 00:17:13.230
A large number of them will be transferred here shortly!

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.530
Got it! Wait just a moment!

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:15.560
We have our team ready.

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.900
What's all the noise about?

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.030
Hurry up and do it, Akira!

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:24.200
It's all I can manage just to keep her trapped inside me.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:26.770
I can't suppress her power, too.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.380
Maia...

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:32.910
Run us through, Akira! You're the savior!

00:17:32.910 --> 00:17:36.540
If things go on like this, more people will die.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:41.620
I... will bring salvation to all!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.390
That includes you!

00:17:52.570 --> 00:17:53.970
That's impossible.

00:17:53.970 --> 00:17:55.940
It is not!

00:18:00.910 --> 00:18:02.610
Please.

00:18:02.610 --> 00:18:07.280
If you end the battle, you'll never have to pilot a Vector again.

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:10.580
And then... you won't have to disappear.

00:18:10.580 --> 00:18:12.780
Please, Akira!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.790
If the alternative is forgetting you...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:25.430
...I'd rather have you shoot and kill me.

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.100
Don't give me that bullshit!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:41.980
Akira!

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:49.280
Akira! Do it, please!
You're the savior, aren't you?!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:19:00.170
I... can't become... the savior.

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:01.800
Akira.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.230
It's over now.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.180
No!

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:23.160
I-It really won't work.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.890
Don't you make a guy's girlfriend cry!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.930
"Tsutomu Domon"

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.160
Ts-Tsutomu?

00:19:44.010 --> 00:19:47.750
Come on, Hayato, Akira...

00:19:47.750 --> 00:19:50.020
Sousei Gattai.

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:54.960
Roar! Aquarion!

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.460
"Phoenix"

00:20:08.070 --> 00:20:12.370
Hey, Akira, that's one glum look you've got on your face.

00:20:12.370 --> 00:20:16.040
There's nothing fun about a life full of hardship.

00:20:16.040 --> 00:20:17.440
Tsutomu!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:19.780
Especially in times like this,

00:20:19.780 --> 00:20:24.890
brightening the world with laughter is a comedian's job!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:28.960
I'm going to bring them back.
All the smiles in the world.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:31.930
Thanks... Tsutomu.

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:49.500
"Amaterasu"

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:54.340
Amaterasu!

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:08.100
Tch!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:10.600
A warm light...

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.000
It's giving me strength...

00:21:26.280 --> 00:21:28.650
That's as far as this goes.

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.140
Impossible.

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:40.630
I wonder if Shoko smiled for me.

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:46.030
I really do like Shoko best when she's smiling...

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:52.170
He did it! You did it, Tsutomu!

00:22:02.650 --> 00:22:04.990
No way...

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:09.890
How is this going to bring back smiles?

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:12.330
I can't...

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:14.420
...smile at all!

00:22:21.000 --> 00:22:26.770
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:42.190
<i>With the warmth of salvation,</i>
<i>I raise my hand into the sky</i>

00:22:42.190 --> 00:22:46.930
<i>and everything in the world gains its true colors</i>

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:49.600
<i>(Focus) A sound that was once hidden</i>

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:52.700
<i>(on the goal) will connect us now</i>

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:55.200
<i>Try to understand that, okay?</i>

00:22:55.200 --> 00:22:57.640
<i>So, are you ready?</i>

00:22:57.640 --> 00:23:00.440
<i>(heart and soul) These silent teardrops</i>

00:23:00.440 --> 00:23:03.040
<i>(narrow escape) that flow forth now</i>

00:23:03.040 --> 00:23:06.550
<i>(enamored) are proof of that person's existence</i>

00:23:06.550 --> 00:23:13.050
<i>You can't go inside your heart all alone</i>

00:23:13.050 --> 00:23:15.620
<i>I will hesitate no more</i>

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:20.790
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:23:20.790 --> 00:23:26.000
<i>A useful life, a sparkling utopia</i>

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:35.110
<i>When your heart and voice</i> <i>tremble together, you'll surpass all</i>

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:38.510
<i>So go for your heart</i>

00:23:51.630 --> 00:23:53.990
I'm gonna be on a bonsai-growing program on TV soon!

00:23:53.990 --> 00:23:55.000
Wow!

00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:57.960
Karan, now, I'm not familiar with idols,

00:23:57.960 --> 00:24:01.600
but will a Saturday morning program aimed at old people help you reach your dream?

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:05.340
I want to reach everyone, not just you, Big Brother!

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:06.610
Episode 22.

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:08.280
"Episode 22: Listen! The Voice

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:08.280
Calling Out to You"

00:24:06.610 --> 00:24:08.610
"Listen! The Voice Calling Out to You."

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:10.300
I'll reach everyone, too!
